Drive tracking is substantially more reliable in this release.

- Trips close about a minute after you park and walk away.
- A stop at a train crossing or drive-through no longer splits one drive in two.
- Drives keep their shape even if your phone's clock drifts.
- Miles are priced at the correct IRS rate for the date you drove.
- Manually entered trips are protected and never overwritten.
- Your CPA export now includes tracked mileage on Schedule C.
